# Excess-IBD regions, hg19/GRCh37, Table 3 of Li H, Glusman G, Hu H, Shankaracharya,
# Caballero J, Hubley R, Witherspoon D, Guthery SL, Mauldin DE, Jorde LB, Hood L,
# Roach JC, Huff CD (2014) "Relationship Estimation from Whole-Genome Sequence Data",
# PLoS Genetics 10(1):e1004144.  PMC3907355.
#
# Criterion: observed/expected total IBD segment length >= 4-fold AND region >= 5 cM,
# measured with GERMLINE, ISCA and fastIBD across European, East Asian and Mexican
# American controls.  14 regions, 119.92 cM total; covers <5% of the genome but 13%
# of centromeric and 47% of unmappable heterochromatic sequence.
# Masking these dropped spurious relationship detection among European controls
# from 10% to 1% (alpha = 0.001, ERSA 2.0 + GERMLINE).
#
# COORDINATES ARE hg19 -- must be lifted to GRCh38 before use here.
